cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its outputs, please cite it as below.
title: "AI strategy research programme: analysis code for national AI strategies, digital health policy and health informatics curricula"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for a programme of studies measuring how national
  artificial intelligence strategies and digital health policy engage
  digital-health and health-informatics competency frameworks, using
  embedding-based alignment of policy and curriculum text against normative
  reference frameworks.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Forrest
    given-names: Jamie I.
    affiliation: Northeastern University
repository-code: "https://github.com/drjforrest/Ai-strategy-series"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - health informatics
  - digital health policy
  - artificial intelligence strategy
  - competency frameworks
  - natural language processing
